hadiths[4]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ali (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Mujh par jhoot na bandho, kyunke jo mujh par jhoot bandhega wo dozakh mein dakhil hoga."
"2","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Mujhe tum se kasrat se hadith bayan karne se ye baat rokti hai ke Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jis ne mujh par jaan-boojh kar jhoot bola, use chahiye ke wo dozakh mein apna thikana bana le."
"3","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Aur jo mujh par jaan-boojh kar jhoot bole, use chahiye ke wo dozakh mein apna thikana bana le."
"4","[AI-translation] Hazrat Mughirah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko farmate hue suna: Beshak mujh par jhoot bandhna kisi aur shakhs par jhoot bandhne ki tarah nahi hai; jo mujh par jaan-boojh kar jhoot bandhe, use chahiye ke wo dozakh mein apna thikana bana le."
